"# event-platform — Software Design Document

> Stack: **go** · Architecture: **event-driven** · Language: **en**
> Generated: 2026-05-04T00:00:00.000Z

Event-driven order delivery

## 1. Executive Summary

**Problem.** Order events must reach the warehouse within 1 second

**Goals**

- Sub-second event delivery

**Key Performance Indicators**

- p99 < 1s end-to-end

NARRATIVE


## 2. Stakeholders & Personas

| ID | Name | Role | Influence | Responsibilities |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| SH-001 | Logistics lead | owner | high | delivery SLAs |


## 3. Product Requirements

**Constraints**

- At-least-once delivery


### 3.1 Functional Requirements

#### FR-001 — Publish OrderPlaced

- **Priority:** must
- **Description:** Emit OrderPlaced when an order is accepted
- **Uses integrations:** INT-001

**Acceptance criteria**

- **AC-FR-001-1** — _Given_ an accepted order _When_ it is committed _Then_ an OrderPlaced event is published to INT-001



## 4. Quality Attributes (NFR)

| ID | Category | Statement | Measurable target | Verification |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| NFR-001 | performance | Event delivery is fast | \`p99 < 1s\` | — |

NARRATIVE


## 5. Glossary

| Term | Definition | Synonyms | Related |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| **Order** | A customer purchase request | — | — |


## 6. System Architecture

> Architectural style: **event-driven** · primary stack: **go**.

NARRATIVE

### 6.1 C4 Context (L1)

\`\`\`mermaid
C4Context
  title System Context — event-platform
  Person(user, "User", "Primary actor of the system")
  System(event_platform, "event-platform", "Event-driven order delivery")
  Rel(user, event_platform, "uses")
  System_Ext(INT_001, "Kafka (message-broker)", "Order event bus")
  Rel(event_platform, INT_001, "message-broker")
\`\`\`

### 6.2 C4 Container (L2)

\`\`\`mermaid
C4Container
  Person(u, "User", "actor")
  Container(api, "API", "stack")
  Rel(u, api, "uses")
\`\`\`

### 6.3 C4 Component (L3)

\`\`\`mermaid
C4Component
  Component(svc, "Service", "core")
\`\`\`


## 7. Detailed Design

### 7.1 Domain Model

- **Order** _(context: Sales)_ — Order aggregate root
  - Entities: Order, LineItem
  - Value objects: Money
  - Events: OrderPlaced, OrderCancelled

\`\`\`mermaid
classDiagram
  class Order {
    +Order
    +LineItem
    -Money
  }
  class OrderPlaced
  Order ..> OrderPlaced : emits
  class OrderCancelled
  Order ..> OrderCancelled : emits
\`\`\`

